# Hijab Booking Chatbot - Built with Botpress

An AI booking assistant for a Hijab Store in Makassar, Indonesia.
This bot handles bookings automatically like a real customer service.

## What This Bot Does

- Asks customer name
- Asks service: Booking Jilbab
- Asks booking date
- Asks booking time
- Summarizes all details
- Asks for confirmation
- Confirms booking automatically

## Live Demo Flow

User: Booking jilbab
Bot: Untuk tanggal berapa ingin booking?
User: Lusa
Bot: Jam berapa?
User: Jam 10.00
Bot: Detail booking-nya... Apakah sudah benar?
User: Iya benar
Bot: Booking jilbab untuk lusa pukul 10.00 sudah dikonfirmasi. Sampai jumpa!

